<newsitem itemid="410025" id="root" date="1997-02-28" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Concor lifts interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Concor lifts interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     109.9	 vs    95.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  17.5	 vs    15.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   14.67	 vs    10.85</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   22.03	 vs    14.61</p>
<p>    Tax			  7.46	 vs    4.19</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    2.37	 vs    3.29</p>
<p>    Turnover		 519.26	 vs    440.73</p>
<p>Div payable March 31</p>
<p>on register March 14</p>
<p>Full name: Concor Ltd (building and construction)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said activity levels in the construction market remained static and it was ready to take advantage of fixed investment which would result from government succesfully implementing its growth strategy.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
